# Question 1: Nth Highest Salary

---

## Problem

Find the 3rd highest salary.

Table:

| salary |
| ------ |
| 90000  |
| 80000  |
| 70000  |
| 60000  |

---

## Beginner Solution

Sort salaries.

Take third one.

---

## SQL Solution

```sql
SELECT salary
FROM
(
    SELECT salary,
           DENSE_RANK() OVER(ORDER BY salary DESC) rnk
    FROM employees
) t
WHERE rnk = 3;
```

---

## Why DENSE_RANK?

Suppose:

| salary |
| ------ |
| 90000  |
| 90000  |
| 80000  |

Ranks become:

| salary | rank |
| ------ | ---- |
| 90000  | 1    |
| 90000  | 1    |
| 80000  | 2    |

Correct.

---

## Recognition Pattern

Question contains:

```text
Nth Highest
Top 3
Top 5
Ranking
```

Think:

```text
ROW_NUMBER
RANK
DENSE_RANK
```

