# Question 2: Top 2 Employees Per Department

---

## Table

| name | dept | salary |
| ---- | ---- | ------ |
| A    | CSE  | 100    |
| B    | CSE  | 90     |
| C    | ECE  | 80     |

---

## SQL

```sql
SELECT *
FROM
(
    SELECT *,
           ROW_NUMBER() OVER
           (
              PARTITION BY dept
              ORDER BY salary DESC
           ) rn
    FROM employees
) t
WHERE rn <= 2;
```

---

## Mental Model

```text
Partition by department

Rank inside department

Take top 2
```

---

## Recognition Pattern

Question says:

```text
Top N per group
```

Immediately think:

```text
PARTITION BY
+
ROW_NUMBER
```

