# Question 3: Customers Who Never Ordered

---

Tables:

Customers

Orders

---

Need:

```text
Customers with NO matching order
```

---

## SQL

```sql
SELECT c.*
FROM customers c
LEFT JOIN orders o
ON c.id = o.customer_id
WHERE o.customer_id IS NULL;
```

---

## Mental Shortcut

Question says:

```text
Never
Missing
No orders
Not assigned
No records
```

Think:

```text
LEFT JOIN
+
IS NULL
```

