# Question 5: Highest Salary in Each Department

---

## SQL

```sql
SELECT dept,
       MAX(salary)
FROM employees
GROUP BY dept;
```

---

## Mental Model

Question says:

```text
Per Department
Per Branch
Per Category
Per Team
```

Think:

```text
GROUP BY
```

