# 🧠 SQL Pattern Cheat Sheet

---

## Duplicate Records

```sql
GROUP BY
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
```

---

## Missing Records

```sql
LEFT JOIN
IS NULL
```

---

## Ranking

```sql
ROW_NUMBER
RANK
DENSE_RANK
```

---

## Top N Per Group

```sql
PARTITION BY
ROW_NUMBER
```

---

## Previous / Next Row

```sql
LAG
LEAD
```

---

## Per Category Statistics

```sql
GROUP BY
```

